Cell["\<\
Figure 4.2  Common swift \[LongDash] monthly population centroid on the \
single Afro-Palearctic flyway. Breeding-season concentration over Europe \
(months ~5\[Dash]8) and the sub-Saharan wintering shift (months ~11\[Dash]2) \
are both clear; no flyway splitting is needed because there is only one \
population.\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{70, 70}, {2, 14}},
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.35],ExpressionUUID->"e491979e-ecb2-475e-bd2a-caa878bfe99d"],

